<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Seven Network year net profit soars.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Seven Network year net profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    119.96 vs  88.54</p>
<p>    Net				     115.13 vs  41.26</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     13.0  vs  12.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Seven Network Ltd is a television network and is about 20 percent owned by Western Australian investor Kerry Stokes and about 15 percent by The News Corporation Ltd. Latest year is for 53 weeks compared with 52 weeks the previous year.</p>
</text>
